<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Caregiver Tools &amp; Downloads &mdash; Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation</title>
<meta name="description" content="Guides, worksheets, checklists and downloads made by Legacy for dementia caregivers.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>


{% set active_page = 'resources' %}
{% include '_header.html.j2' %}

<section class="hero" style="padding: 56px 0 64px;">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#eeddd2;"><a href="resources.html" style="color:#eeddd2;">Resource Hub</a></p>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);">Caregiver Tools &amp; Downloads</h1>
    <p class="lede">Practical things to print, fill in, and take with you — to appointments, to family conversations, to the days that are hard.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    {% with collection = caregiver_tools %}{% include '_resource-links.html.j2' %}{% endwith %}
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--sand);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>Looking for something else?</h2></div>
    <div class="card-grid mt-24">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Resource Directory</h3>
        <p>Crisis lines, county services, respite funding and more, searchable in one place.</p>
        <a class="more" href="directory.html">Browse the directory &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
        <p>Plain answers to what caregivers ask us most.</p>
        <a class="more" href="faq.html">Read the FAQ &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Talk to us</h3>
        <p>If you cannot find what you need, ask. A person will get back to you.</p>
        <a class="more" href="request-support.html">Request support &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include '_footer.html.j2' %}

<script src="app.js"></script>
<script src="nav-v2.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
